"Automatic updates pause for 3 days, so the same update doesn't come straight "
"back. They turn back on by themselves."
msgstr ""
"Pembaruan otomatis dijeda selama 3 hari, jadi pembaruan yang sama tidak "
"langsung muncul lagi. Pembaruan otomatis akan aktif kembali dengan "
