msgid "Welcome to EvenKeelOS"
msgstr "Selamat datang di EvenKeelOS"

msgid ""
"Welcome. A few things to set up, one at a time.\n"
"\n"
"1. Media codecs, for web video\n"
"2. Skip the disk password at startup\n"
"3. How to get apps\n"
"\n"
"Each can be skipped.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Start. Or Later: this opens again at the next login. Or Don't show again: it's in Wheelhouse any time."
msgstr ""
"Selamat datang. Ada beberapa hal yang perlu disiapkan, satu per satu.\n"
"\n"
"1. Codec media, untuk video web\n"
"2. Lewati kata sandi disk saat penyalaan\n"
"3. Cara mendapatkan aplikasi\n"
"\n"
"Masing-masing bisa dilewati.\n"
"\n"
"Disarankan: Mulai. Atau Nanti: ini terbuka lagi saat Anda masuk berikutnya. Atau Jangan tampilkan lagi: tersedia di Wheelhouse kapan saja."

