" installs it."
msgstr ""
"Program Windows (.exe dan .msi) tidak bisa berjalan di sini. Buka saja: "
"Wheelhouse memberi tahu Anda versi untuk EvenKeelOS, atau penggantinya jika "
"ada, lalu menginstalnya."

msgid "Windows programs (.exe, .msi)"
msgstr "Program Windows (.exe, .msi)"

msgid "Windows-style"
msgstr "Gaya Windows"

msgid "Windows-style bottom bar or the standard top bar"
msgstr "Bilah bawah bergaya Windows atau bilah atas standar"

msgid "Wired"
msgstr "Kabel"

msgid "Wired network"
msgstr "Jaringan kabel"

msgid "Wired network: connected."
msgstr "Jaringan kabel: terhubung."

msgid "Wired network: not connected."
msgstr "Jaringan kabel: tidak terhubung."

msgid ""
"With the Windows-style layout: click the sailboat button at the bottom left, "
"then Wheelhouse."
msgstr ""
"Dengan tata letak gaya Windows: klik tombol perahu layar di kiri bawah, lalu "
"Wheelhouse."

msgid ""
"With the Windows-style layout: click the sailboat button at the bottom left, "
"then click the app, or start typing its name and press Enter."
msgstr ""
"Dengan tata letak gaya Windows: klik tombol perahu layar di kiri bawah, lalu "
"klik aplikasi, atau mulai ketik namanya dan tekan Enter."

msgid ""
"With the standard layout: click the logo at the top left, then Wheelhouse."
msgstr "Dengan tata letak standar: klik logo di kiri atas, lalu Wheelhouse."

msgid ""
"With the standard layout: press the Windows key, start typing the app's name,"
" and press Enter. Or press Windows key + A to see every app."
msgstr ""
"Dengan tata letak standar: tekan tombol Windows, mulai ketik nama aplikasi, "
"lalu tekan Enter. Atau tekan tombol Windows + A untuk melihat semua aplikasi."

msgid ""
"Word, Excel and PowerPoint: LibreOffice Writer, Calc and Impress. They open "
"and save Office files."
msgstr ""
"Word, Excel, dan PowerPoint: LibreOffice Writer, Calc, dan Impress. Ketiganya"
" membuka dan menyimpan berkas Office."

msgid "Work"
msgstr "Kantor"

msgid ""
"Work: like a Public place, nothing gets in and your folders aren't shared. "
"The office's own shared drives still open."
msgstr ""
"Kantor: seperti Tempat umum, tidak ada yang bisa masuk dan folder Anda tidak "
"dibagikan. Drive bersama milik kantor tetap bisa dibuka."

msgid "Working…"
msgstr "Sedang memproses…"

msgid "Year"
msgstr "Tahun"

msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Ya"

